==Battleground==
*3 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start off by stalling the Gabriels and Cerberus Kids and picking them off with [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] cats to build up cash. Once Rangmaster spawns, start building up a stack of [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]]/[[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon]]/[[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cats]] to outrange and damage Rangmaster and his supporting Angel enemies. If you have [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]], he can be of great help in piercing Rangmaster's shield to let your Dragons damage him. Spawn Bullet Train and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for supplementary damage, and bring 3 meatshields to stall Rangmaster and Chickful A (Manic Mohawk, Manic Eraser and Eraser Cat work well). If you run out of cash, stop spawning Dragons and focus on protecting your stack. Rangmaster will fall eventually.

